Dear Lisa van Wyk,

I hope you are well at Jacaranda Panel Beaters.

Welcome to the November 2026 edition of the CloudDesk Mail customer newsletter. I am Anele Dlamini and I share a short update each month on what is new and what is coming.

Product news this month includes faster search across folders, a cleaner layout for the inbox on smaller screens, and a new option to save regular drafts for quotes and job updates.

Seasonal tip as we head towards summer is to set up filters for leave requests and year end orders, so the right team member can pick up mail while others are away.

